{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "PSA",
  "chapter": 22,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.22.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My God, my God, why hast thou forsaken me?",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "Why art thou so",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " far from helping me, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and from",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the words of my groaning?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.22.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "O my God, I cry in the daytime, but thou answerest not;\nAnd in the night season, and am not silent.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.22.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But thou art holy,\nO thou that inhabitest the praises of Israel.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.22.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Our fathers trusted in thee:\nThey trusted, and thou didst deliver them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.22.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They cried unto thee, and were delivered:\nThey trusted in thee, and were not put to shame.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.22.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But I am a worm, and no man;\nA reproach of men, and despised of the people.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.22.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "All they that see me laugh me to scorn:\nThey shoot out the lip, they shake the head, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "saying",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ",",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.22.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Commit ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "thyself",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " unto Jehovah; let him deliver him:\nLet him rescue him, seeing he delighteth in him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.22.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But thou art he that took me out of the womb;\nThou didst make me trust ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "when I was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " upon my mother’s breasts.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.22.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I was cast upon thee from the womb;\nThou art my God since my mother bare me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.22.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Be not far from me; for trouble is near;\nFor there is none to help.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.22.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Many bulls have compassed me;\nStrong bulls of Bashan have beset me round.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.22.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They gape upon me with their mouth,",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "As",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a ravening and a roaring lion.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.22.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I am poured out like water,\nAnd all my bones are out of joint:\nMy heart is like wax;\nIt is melted within me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.22.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My strength is dried up like a potsherd;\nAnd my tongue cleaveth to my jaws;\nAnd thou hast brought me into the dust of death.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.22.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For dogs have compassed me:\nA company of evil-doers have inclosed me;They pierced my hands and my feet.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.22.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I may count all my bones.\nThey look and stare upon me;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.22.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They part my garments among them,\nAnd upon my vesture do they cast lots.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.22.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But be not thou far off, O Jehovah:\nO thou my succor, haste thee to help me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.22.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Deliver my soul from the sword,\nMy darling from the power of the dog.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.22.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Save me from the lion’s mouth;\nYea, from the horns of the wild-oxen thou hast answered me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.22.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I will declare thy name unto my brethren:\nIn the midst of the assembly will I praise thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.22.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Ye that fear Jehovah, praise him;\nAll ye the seed of Jacob, glorify him;\nAnd stand in awe of him, all ye the seed of Israel.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.22.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For he hath not despised nor abhorred the affliction of the afflicted;\nNeither hath he hid his face from him;\nBut when he cried unto him, he heard.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.22.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Of thee cometh my praise in the great assembly:\nI will pay my vows before them that fear him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.22.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The meek shall eat and be satisfied;\nThey shall praise Jehovah that seek after him:\nLet your heart live for ever.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.22.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "All the ends of the earth shall remember and turn unto Jehovah;\nAnd all the kindreds of the nations shall worship before thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.22.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For the kingdom is Jehovah’s;\nAnd he is the ruler over the nations.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.22.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "All the fat ones of the earth shall eat and worship:\nAll they that go down to the dust shall bow before him,\nEven he that cannot keep his soul alive.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.30",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.22.30",
      "verse": 30,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A seed shall serve him;\nIt shall be told of the Lord unto the ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "next",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " generation.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.31",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.22.31",
      "verse": 31,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They shall come and shall declare his righteousness\nUnto a people that shall be born, that he hath done it.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ],
  "headings": [
    {
      "style": "s1",
      "text": "A cry of anguish, and a song of praise.",
      "before_verse": 1
    },
    {
      "style": "d",
      "text": "For the Chief Musician; set to That is, The hind of the morning.Aijeleth hash-Shahar. A Psalm of David.",
      "before_verse": 1
    }
  ]
}
